    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/1f5ce233cc67e7814553864ac5315115.poster.avif?t=1743055407\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/1f5ce233cc67e7814553864ac5315115.webm?t=1743055407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/1f5ce233cc67e7814553864ac5315115.mp4?t=1743055407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fog-drenched ruins of <strong><i>West Hollow</i></strong>, a crumbling town where shadows stretch too long and silence hides danger. Search for a lost love amid haunted streets, abandoned diners, and forsaken schools, piecing together a truth buried in the mist. Armed with little more than a flashlight, explore a world of eerie echoes and unseen threats\u2014every corner holds a whisper, every step a risk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/999f78fa69fa3d8f6ac37e6352f03bf7.poster.avif?t=1743055407\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/999f78fa69fa3d8f6ac37e6352f03bf7.webm?t=1743055407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/999f78fa69fa3d8f6ac37e6352f03bf7.mp4?t=1743055407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery of a quiet little town turned nightmare in this atmospheric blend of exploration and survival, where  answers might come at a cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, detailed environment that rewards players who explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of <i>Firewatch\u00a0</i>and <i>What Remains of Edith Finch</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/1f5ce233cc67e7814553864ac5315115.poster.avif?t=1743055407\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/1f5ce233cc67e7814553864ac5315115.webm?t=1743055407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/1f5ce233cc67e7814553864ac5315115.mp4?t=1743055407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fog-drenched ruins of <strong><i>West Hollow</i></strong>, a crumbling town where shadows stretch too long and silence hides danger. Search for a lost love amid haunted streets, abandoned diners, and forsaken schools, piecing together a truth buried in the mist. Armed with little more than a flashlight, explore a world of eerie echoes and unseen threats\u2014every corner holds a whisper, every step a risk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/999f78fa69fa3d8f6ac37e6352f03bf7.poster.avif?t=1743055407\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/999f78fa69fa3d8f6ac37e6352f03bf7.webm?t=1743055407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/999f78fa69fa3d8f6ac37e6352f03bf7.mp4?t=1743055407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery of a quiet little town turned nightmare in this atmospheric blend of exploration and survival, where  answers might come at a cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, detailed environment that rewards players who explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of <i>Firewatch\u00a0</i>and <i>What Remains of Edith Finch</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
